  "title": "Stuffed Baked Peaches",
  "description": "Toasted almonds, brown sugar, and butter are blended in a food processor and spooned into peaches to be baked in orange-flavored brandy liqueur for a tasty and unique dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim Nichols"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:13:12-05:00",
